        <p>Xepub is a new EPUB reader application from the Linux Mint team, announced on September 11, 2026 as part of the XApp cross-desktop application family. It provides Kindle/Kobo-style chapter navigation, bookmarks, reading-position memory, word-level dictionary lookup with configurable search URLs, and colored highlights with notes.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
